OL,3,GNEWSAIreland's relationship with UK
OL,4,Aunder Burnham off to 'very good start'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIreland's relationship with the UK
OL,7,Funder Andy Burnham's premiership has
OL,8,Fgot off to a "very good start",
OL,9,FTaoiseach (Irish prime minister)
OL,10,FMicheal Martin has said.
OL,12,FBut he refused to be drawn on how much
OL,13,Fthe issue of Irish unity had featured
OL,14,Fduring their first official meeting at
OL,15,FNumber 10 North on Friday.
OL,17,FThe visit came days after US President
OL,18,FDonald Trump made comments about
OL,19,Fsupporting a "unified Ireland".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
