OL,3,GNEWSAIreland's relationship with UK
OL,4,Aunder Burnham off to 'very good start'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin said the men had a "broad
OL,7,Fdiscussion" about upholding the Good
OL,8,FFriday Agreement and that they did not
OL,9,Fget into specifics.
